msgstr "一项投入或资源"

#: ../../notation.md 5d2e2083f8274ca1895e4324d53a1397
msgid "$r=1,\\ldots,s$"
msgstr "$r=1,\\ldots,s$"

#: ../../notation.md 1633e0f0d4494895ab1ed488c2e3e7e4
msgid "a desirable output, service, or outcome"
msgstr "一项合意产出、服务或结果"

#: ../../notation.md 765d587d87b3400394d6811dde4d0dd8
msgid "$h=1,\\ldots,q$"
msgstr "$h=1,\\ldots,q$"

#: ../../notation.md 01189cc3ee404152a04bac1b8c84c830
msgid "an undesirable output or burden"
msgstr "一项非合意产出或负担"

#: ../../notation.md 88b62f6a01a74ead9f4d9904986ecaa6
msgid "$t=1,\\ldots,T$"
msgstr "$t=1,\\ldots,T$"

#: ../../notation.md 2c5f34eaca75467b87bc2bcc67481efd
msgid "a time period"
msgstr "一个时期"

#: ../../notation.md b6ae510e4b614670965ef6462e2e8204
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\sigma\\in\\{1,\\ldots,T\\}$"
msgstr "$\\sigma\\in\\{1,\\ldots,T\\}$"

#: ../../notation.md 41ee5c2f9b3e483fb91ea970a776c822
msgid ""
"the period of an operating plan being evaluated in generic cross-period "
"notation"
msgstr "在通用跨期符号中，接受评价的经营方案所属时期"

#: ../../notation.md 2fc3fad24f864ef4add49e6baeb0e932
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\tau\\in\\{1,\\ldots,T\\}$"
msgstr "$\\tau\\in\\{1,\\ldots,T\\}$"

#: ../../notation.md aa76e2db63df401f9c208b75c1f633e4
msgid ""
"the period supplying the reference technology in generic cross-period "
"notation"
msgstr "在通用跨期符号中，提供参照技术的时期"

#: ../../notation.md af9fd46570274964a62ea9009be5aa8e
msgid "$\\kappa=1,\\ldots,G$"
msgstr "$\\kappa=1,\\ldots,G$"

#: ../../notation.md 211f311016df449a9e79f1e5d681cdf7
msgid "a declared operating or technology group"
msgstr "一个预先声明的经营群组或技术群组"

#: ../../notation.md 70f31f5dbbcc4f5aae0744887397b122
msgid "$k,\\ell=1,\\ldots,K$"
msgstr "$k,\\ell=1,\\ldots,K$"

#: ../../notation.md 0e083fd1dd2d4d13bb62ee6a658f83df
msgid "processes or divisions inside an organization"
msgstr "组织内部的过程或部门"

#: ../../notation.md:28 f460a83d9ba846888644f4a15c6d0a74
msgid ""
"The book retains **DMU** when referring to the standard DEA term *decision-"
"making unit*. In applications, more concrete words such as hospital, plant, "
"bank, municipality, or organization are usually more informative."
msgstr ""
"提及 DEA 的标准术语 *decision-making unit* 时，本书保留 "
"**DMU**。在应用中，医院、工厂、银行、市政单位或组织等具体称谓通常更有信息。"

#: ../../notation.md:33 42865efb14664650907d1a1ab764a22f
msgid ""
"For organization $j$ in period $t$, the standard positive-quantity chapters "
"write"
msgstr "对于时期 $t$ 的组织 $j$，采用正数量的标准章节写作"

#: ../../notation.md:36 8bfecff66c294ad29406b584c7f30a65
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_j^t\\in\\mathbb R_+^m,\\qquad\n"
"y_j^t\\in\\mathbb R_+^s,\\qquad\n"
"b_j^t\\in\\mathbb R_+^q\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"x_j^t\\in\\mathbb R_+^m,\\qquad\n"
"y_j^t\\in\\mathbb R_+^s,\\qquad\n"
"b_j^t\\in\\mathbb R_+^q\n"

#: ../../notation.md:42 f42228cb4911404eb1b3d3b72e815042
msgid ""
"denote inputs, desirable outputs, and undesirable outputs. When pollution or"
" another undesirable output is absent, the $b$ term is omitted rather than "
"carried through the equations as an empty object."
msgstr "分别表示投入、合意产出和非合意产出。没有污染或其他非合意产出时，公式直接省略 $b$ 项，而不把它作为空对象一直保留。"

#: ../../notation.md:46 f22d6eed4a624b68babf4481bfb0116b
msgid ""
"Signed accounts, quasi-fixed resources, and other specialized data roles "
"have additional domain requirements. The relevant chapter introduces their "
"economic meaning and notation; the DEAPack Documentation gives the "
"corresponding data requirements and parameter definitions."
msgstr "带符号的核算、准固定资源和其他专门数据角色有额外的定义域要求。相关章节会介绍其经济含义和符号；DEAPack 文档则给出对应的数据要求与参数定义。"

#: ../../notation.md:51 9f4d96edc4b94f1fb8ceb569a9c4a5ec
msgid "Reference matrices place organizations in columns:"
msgstr "参照矩阵以组织为列："

#: ../../notation.md:53 600121e5b908479892d217b5f2867512
msgid ""
"\n"
"X=[x_1,\\ldots,x_n],\\qquad\n"
"Y=[y_1,\\ldots,y_n],\\qquad\n"
"B=[b_1,\\ldots,b_n].\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"X=[x_1,\\ldots,x_n],\\qquad\n"
"Y=[y_1,\\ldots,y_n],\\qquad\n"
"B=[b_1,\\ldots,b_n].\n"

#: ../../notation.md:59 74e8d2f1623e4bd3a80eb7e24b348b31
msgid ""
"User data are ordinarily arranged the other way around, with one "
"organization or organization-period observation per row. DEAPack accepts "
"this row-oriented form and constructs the reference matrices used by the "
"model."
msgstr "用户数据通常采用相反的排列方式，每行对应一个组织或一个组织—时期观测。DEAPack 接受这种按行排列的形式，并在模型内部构造参照矩阵。"

#: ../../notation.md:63 037243785a1b4d6eafbe7f00a1db751a
msgid ""
"The candidate roster assembled during a data audit is not automatically the "
"reference sample. Only observations that pass the study's pre-declared "
"eligibility rule enter $X$, $Y$, and, where relevant, $B$. Among those "
"eligible observations, the fitted plan's nonzero $\\lambda_j$ values "
"identify the active peers for organization $o$. Candidate record, eligible "
"comparator, and active peer are therefore three different statuses."
msgstr ""
"数据审计阶段形成的候选名单不会自动成为参照样本。只有通过研究预先声明的资格规则的观测，才进入 $X$、$Y$，以及适用时的 "
"$B$。在这些合格观测中，拟合方案里非零的 $\\lambda_j$ 标示组织 $o$ "
"的活跃参照单元。因此，候选记录、合格比较对象和活跃参照单元是三种不同状态。"

#: ../../notation.md:70 c509fd97c3094ebba873f53935d17876
msgid ""
"For a group/metafrontier comparison, $X_\\kappa,Y_\\kappa$ retain only "
"eligible observations from declared group $\\kappa$, while $X_M,Y_M$ pool "
"eligible observations from every declared group. The subscript $M$ means "
"*metafrontier*; it is not a time period."
msgstr ""
"在群组前沿与共同前沿的比较中，$X_\\kappa,Y_\\kappa$ 只保留预先声明的群组 $\\kappa$ 中的合格观测，$X_M,Y_M$ "
"则汇集所有已声明群组中的合格观测。下标 $M$ 表示 *metafrontier*，并非时期。"

#: ../../notation.md:75 b92884dcc1fe4ce1a79aaf0aeb37aac5
msgid "Production opportunities and comparator weights"
msgstr "生产机会与比较对象权重"

#: ../../notation.md:77 8cd7edf6585e4ace86f03b1c1a9d9ae6
msgid "The production technology"
msgstr "生产技术"

#: ../../notation.md:79 284856ca08bf43c787f6cb832dfc55c2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal T=\\{(x,y):x\\text{ can produce }y\\}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal T=\\{(x,y):x\\text{ 可生产 }y\\}\n"

#: ../../notation.md:83 071a2e15d183436c80001562cb31675b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"collects the operating plans treated as attainable under the assumptions of "
"the study. With undesirable outputs it is written $\\mathcal "
"T=\\{(x,y,b):x\\text{ can jointly produce }(y,b)\\}$. The hat in "
"$\\widehat{\\mathcal T}$ emphasizes that the technology has been estimated "
"from a sample."
msgstr ""
"汇集在研究假设下视为可实现的经营方案。含有非合意产出时写作 $\\mathcal T=\\{(x,y,b):x\\text{ 可联合生产 "
"}(y,b)\\}$。$\\widehat{\\mathcal T}$ 上方的帽号强调该技术由样本估计而来。"

#: ../../notation.md:89 5d4fb62db1964e61832ddc729d6c823c
msgid ""
"The vector $\\lambda\\geq0$ combines observed activities into a comparator "
"plan. Nonzero $\\lambda_j$ values identify the observations contributing to "
"that plan; they are not instructions to merge organizations literally."
msgstr ""
"向量 $\\lambda\\geq0$ 把观测活动组合成一个比较方案。非零的 $\\lambda_j$ "
"标示哪些观测参与构造该方案，并不是要求这些组织在现实中合并。"

#: ../../notation.md:93 1bccff06f7dd4d52b7b873035295577b
msgid ""
"The activity-specific weak-disposal construction instead decomposes a "
"reference activity into retained and curtailed parts, $\\mu_j$ and "
"$\\eta_j$. When $\\mu_j+\\eta_j>0$, its retained activity rate is "
"$r_j=\\mu_j/(\\mu_j+\\eta_j)$. The symbol $r_j$ is kept distinct from the "
"Farrell input score $\\theta_o$."
msgstr ""
"活动特定的弱处置构造改用 $\\mu_j$ 和 $\\eta_j$，把一项参照活动分解为保留部分与削减部分。当 $\\mu_j+\\eta_j>0$ "
"时，其活动保留率为 $r_j=\\mu_j/(\\mu_j+\\eta_j)$。符号 $r_j$ 与 Farrell 投入得分 $\\theta_o$ "
"明确区分。"

#: ../../notation.md ad553a4f992942f8866d5080bec1ef0e
msgid "Scale assumption"
msgstr "规模假设"

#: ../../notation.md 7d37d74580f8412dbe4c931b1cbd2585
msgid "Restriction on $\\lambda$"
msgstr "$\\lambda$ 的限制"

#: ../../notation.md 73335d2bfc6a4d3b99c1267cbb762067
msgid "Management reading"
msgstr "管理含义"

#: ../../notation.md d1ecc6f2d3f740a69efcbca18ba69f00
msgid "CRS"
msgstr "CRS"

#: ../../notation.md 9a68703e612b4f979665872ccb3f89fd
msgid "$\\lambda\\geq0$"
msgstr "$\\lambda\\geq0$"

#: ../../notation.md f7cdac04610b459595c32526dc435f60
msgid "proportional replication is admitted"
msgstr "允许按比例复制生产活动"

#: ../../notation.md 3c64bd0d72164214838f72f0def1ab47
msgid "VRS"
msgstr "VRS"

#: ../../notation.md 51ca76a77ed845158319bc740bf3b71a
msgid "$\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda=1$"
msgstr "$\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda=1$"

#: ../../notation.md 387c2ca5832f423781fffbb786e43d66
msgid "best practice may vary with operating scale"
msgstr "最佳实践可以随经营规模而异"

#: ../../notation.md 2a06db9f11b549929c8c460b4deab0c4
msgid "NIRS"
msgstr "NIRS"

#: ../../notation.md 26f26e32cb2a4c79b0388ef80186a4ec
msgid "$\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda\\leq1$"
msgstr "$\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda\\leq1$"

#: ../../notation.md a9513af0be324fe289d3dfbd212c0a1e
msgid "unrestricted expansion is not admitted"
msgstr "不允许不受限制地扩张"

#: ../../notation.md 9ca69fafa2624084abccc0122a3d96b6
msgid "NDRS"
msgstr "NDRS"

#: ../../notation.md cc2f1734868945b993e590c990257290
msgid "$\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda\\geq1$"
msgstr "$\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda\\geq1$"

#: ../../notation.md 6e6fdda85a464251a16d8e3574f8f720
msgid "unrestricted contraction is not admitted"
msgstr "不允许不受限制地收缩"

#: ../../notation.md:106 b12454964e074d22bedbc06e0e7857ee
msgid ""
"These are assumptions about attainable production, not devices for obtaining"
" a preferred ranking."
msgstr "这些是关于可实现生产活动的假设，不是为了得到某种理想排名而设置的工具。"

#: ../../notation.md:109 72e9f8603ab742c3bab4633e6085f40b
msgid "Scores describe different performance questions"
msgstr "不同得分回答不同的绩效问题"

#: ../../notation.md:111 5d9b3fc3d0af4119b699a43ded49574f
msgid ""
"The same technology can support several legitimate measures. Their symbols "
"and numerical directions should not be interchanged."
msgstr "同一项生产技术可以支持多种合理测度；不可混用它们的符号和数值方向。"

#: ../../notation.md 883f39bc8e184cea92ed49e4e53b74d4
msgid "Quantity"
msgstr "数量"

#: ../../notation.md 96390bf171434752a4c01d2b9bd7a447
msgid "Best value or direction"
msgstr "最优值或数值方向"

#: ../../notation.md 4d9f7b49eb7a46199c35a811f5ea0cdc
msgid "Interpretation"
msgstr "解释"

#: ../../notation.md 93664f8929114b839724366c27980926
msgid "$\\theta_o$"
msgstr "$\\theta_o$"

#: ../../notation.md adfee151bdf347489443e31696751d04
#: c26bf64471604f5fb263b51fab6dfc81
msgid "$1$; higher is better on a within-technology appraisal"
msgstr "$1$；在同一技术内评价时越大越好"

#: ../../notation.md 8cd78b1d158a4a7490a712313804be32
msgid ""
"Farrell input factor: the retained common share of inputs in the ordinary "
"self-inclusive case"
msgstr "Farrell 投入因子：在通常包含自身观测的情形下，表示各项投入共同保留的比例"

#: ../../notation.md 27e685e240864f639aaadf860e38fbed
msgid "$\\phi_o$"
msgstr "$\\phi_o$"

#: ../../notation.md 810139ff038e483ebe8a3a8262dab5f3
msgid ""
"$1$; smaller is better when a within-technology appraisal gives "
"$\\phi_o\\geq1$"
msgstr "$1$；同一技术内评价得到 $\\phi_o\\geq1$ 时越小越好"

#: ../../notation.md 6951e8b25dc043feb993b92f1be632f9
msgid "Farrell output expansion factor"
msgstr "Farrell 产出扩张因子"

#: ../../notation.md 336728e1c32b47a48cd519a33f6b5a29
msgid "$1/\\phi_o$"
msgstr "$1/\\phi_o$"

#: ../../notation.md 3b73c5b785a84f6f9b7f7b0988fa24dd
msgid ""
"standardized output-oriented Farrell efficiency; bounded by one only when "
"the evaluated plan belongs to the reference technology"
msgstr "标准化的产出导向 Farrell 效率；只有接受评价的方案属于参照技术时才以 1 为上界"

#: ../../notation.md 8dc32a56ebe3451b9c33dd93117c82bb
msgid "$E_o^G,E_o^M$"
msgstr "$E_o^G,E_o^M$"

#: ../../notation.md 1c049d9ddb064bf9b490efde7965e6db
#: 22bb66bb6d5d4e08b148311c1454a95b c24de605091f483888328c822334ad52
#: cd36e53db2ff4d67bb5b4fe219b20c0f
msgid "$1$; higher is better"
msgstr "$1$；越大越好"

#: ../../notation.md 5d7da45736b14085a7261e27a46d604d
msgid ""
"radial efficiency against the focal organization's group frontier and the "
"pooled metafrontier"
msgstr "分别相对于焦点组织的群组前沿和汇集共同前沿的径向效率"

#: ../../notation.md 3b50d622794a438683e0d4a98326468d
msgid "$MTR_o=E_o^M/E_o^G$"
msgstr "$MTR_o=E_o^M/E_o^G$"

#: ../../notation.md 9f6965f693494c9ea10312e319b7e060
msgid "$1$; higher means a smaller opportunity gap"
msgstr "$1$；数值越大表示生产机会差距越小"

#: ../../notation.md 5b805edea351401fb63176497105df67
msgid "metatechnology ratio, historically also called the technology gap ratio (TGR)"
msgstr "共同技术比率，历史上也称技术差距比（TGR）"

#: ../../notation.md 433e89c325c24481acf76f3a9c05c43f
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\rho_o^I,\\rho_o^O,\\rho_o^{NO}$"
msgstr "$\\rho_o^I,\\rho_o^O,\\rho_o^{NO}$"

#: ../../notation.md cfbf686ed4394388bda0dcb4b148f5d1
msgid "input-, output-, and non-oriented SBM efficiency scores"
msgstr "投入导向、产出导向和非导向的 SBM 效率得分"

#: ../../notation.md 09684879754140a69cda6a967245f9fe
msgid "$\\rho_o^B$"
msgstr "$\\rho_o^B$"

#: ../../notation.md 2b64a2d29fe34aa6936d30e805bcc812
msgid "separable strong-disposal undesirable-output SBM efficiency score"
msgstr "可分强处置的非合意产出 SBM 效率得分"

#: ../../notation.md d0652e6f722a44b88592e0e3510ce44e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\rho_o^{RAM}$"
msgstr "$\\rho_o^{RAM}$"

#: ../../notation.md 8bad2e4530d9416db107b53b49f49f53
msgid "range-adjusted efficiency relative to the declared sample ranges"
msgstr "相对于已声明样本极差进行调整的效率"

#: ../../notation.md d451bde8b5f947eb8951abcd9885787d
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\delta_o^{RAM}=1-\\rho_o^{RAM}$"
msgstr "$\\delta_o^{RAM}=1-\\rho_o^{RAM}$"

#: ../../notation.md 0e1a58bf2df44e4290f8705a74e1d643
msgid "$0$; lower is better"
msgstr "$0$；越小越好"

#: ../../notation.md cb360d786e1b4880b6da2003cb7762f6
msgid "range-adjusted inefficiency relative to the declared sample ranges"
msgstr "相对于已声明样本极差进行调整的无效率"

#: ../../notation.md 920e6fc57922467498fd82963dbf8241
msgid "$\\beta_o$"
msgstr "$\\beta_o$"

#: ../../notation.md 30bf547ed13d4b6285456d607777a11d
msgid ""
"$0$ is the contemporaneous boundary; larger values mean more remaining "
"attainable improvement under the same direction"
msgstr "$0$ 表示当期边界；数值越大，表示在同一方向下仍可实现的改进越多"

#: ../../notation.md d1fbf8d2bf2743a88f649574a8a19db1
msgid ""
"directional distance under the declared programme; a signed cross-technology"
" value may be negative"
msgstr "在已声明改进方案下的方向性距离；带符号的跨技术取值可以为负"

#: ../../notation.md 3c1df521e6834ac595dda0bdd177b78b
msgid "$\\delta_o$"
msgstr "$\\delta_o$"

#: ../../notation.md 5c84d6028a4749339ac131afdaab056c
msgid "$0$; larger values mean more weighted slack"
msgstr "$0$；数值越大表示加权松弛越多"

#: ../../notation.md f89fff2252944be087ae07df93122b35
msgid "an additive inefficiency quantity"
msgstr "加性无效率数量"

#: ../../notation.md 2b69ad9a03a749b79cf2feff079e592c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$M_o^{t,t+1}$"
msgstr "$M_o^{t,t+1}$"

#: ../../notation.md d0b352094d1b48e5828934e32056b8f0
msgid "$1$; values above one mean growth"
msgstr "$1$；大于 1 表示增长"

#: ../../notation.md 671ddfae68bf44a682780055daafa527
msgid "a multiplicative productivity-change index"
msgstr "乘法生产率变化指数"

#: ../../notation.md 5b87dc318da64759804621ebf6e95870
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$L_o^{t,t+1}$"
msgstr "$L_o^{t,t+1}$"

#: ../../notation.md 8078f9ef62bf423f8cfd9c5fb2c11bde
msgid "$0$; positive values mean improvement"
msgstr "$0$；正值表示改善"

#: ../../notation.md ab2c1deeb5f14083b77007b04b58520c
msgid "an additive productivity-change indicator"
msgstr "加法生产率变化指标"

#: ../../notation.md 3a872fa97ea945e0b4d839f1158b3b7a
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$Q_{y,o}^{t,t+1}$"
msgstr "$Q_{y,o}^{t,t+1}$"

#: ../../notation.md 585826d2649c4d84924845d478c8934f
msgid "$1$; values above one mean aggregate output growth"
msgstr "$1$；大于 1 表示总产出增长"

#: ../../notation.md 15a1baed6f9c463187114893aa996986
msgid "Hicks--Moorsteen output quantity index"
msgstr "Hicks--Moorsteen 产出数量指数"

#: ../../notation.md be910fcdb251460ab603d713b3aa6e82
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$Q_{x,o}^{t,t+1}$"
msgstr "$Q_{x,o}^{t,t+1}$"

#: ../../notation.md 927f0fd564f84a6c8d06fbe81dd97be1
msgid "$1$; values above one mean aggregate input growth"
msgstr "$1$；大于 1 表示总投入增长"

#: ../../notation.md 5c07d444ecd74b738fea101c833fbbd7
msgid "Hicks--Moorsteen input quantity index"
msgstr "Hicks--Moorsteen 投入数量指数"

#: ../../notation.md a9ac3eadc71f492d98ed108c48496d47
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$HM_o^{t,t+1}=Q_{y,o}^{t,t+1}/Q_{x,o}^{t,t+1}$"
msgstr "$HM_o^{t,t+1}=Q_{y,o}^{t,t+1}/Q_{x,o}^{t,t+1}$"

#: ../../notation.md bc147f21a2c84e7badbece38f688b2a3
msgid "$1$; values above one mean productivity growth"
msgstr "$1$；大于 1 表示生产率增长"

#: ../../notation.md 8236045066e44b63ae0986c15ee11c52
msgid "complete output-quantity growth relative to input-quantity growth"
msgstr "产出总量相对于投入总量的增长"

#: ../../notation.md:133 fae565a5cc9e4fc3bca80f5d0994608e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Farrell measures ask for common proportional input saving or output "
"expansion {cite:p}`farrell1957`. A directional distance instead evaluates a "
"declared bundle of quantity changes; its direction and units are part of the"
" result {cite:p}`chambers1996`. SBM values variable-specific proportional "
"slacks {cite:p}`tone2001`. Productivity indexes compare operating "
"performance across time rather than reporting a static efficiency level "
"{cite:p}`fare1994`."
msgstr ""
"Farrell 测度考察各项投入按共同尺度节约或各项产出按共同尺度扩张 "
"{cite:p}`farrell1957`。方向性距离评价预先声明的一组数量变化，其方向和单位都是结果的组成部分 "
"{cite:p}`chambers1996`。SBM 对各变量特定的比例松弛进行评价 "
"{cite:p}`tone2001`。生产率指数比较跨期经营表现，而不是报告静态效率水平 {cite:p}`fare1994`。"

#: ../../notation.md:140 d80f1ba668c94d99a40ecb5470687cc8
msgid ""
"Throughout the book, lowercase $d$ identifies an efficiency-form radial "
"evaluation, while unarrowed uppercase $D$ with a declared direction $g$ "
"identifies a directional evaluation. When the two temporal roles must be "
"distinguished, the full forms are $d^\\tau(z^\\sigma)$ and "
"$D^\\tau(z^\\sigma;g^\\sigma)$. Their compact forms are $d_\\sigma^\\tau$ "
"and $D_\\sigma^\\tau$. In either form, the superscript $\\tau$ identifies "
"the period supplying the reference technology, while $\\sigma$ identifies "
"the period of the operating plan being evaluated. A superscript $G$ "
"identifies a declared full-horizon global technology rather than a calendar "
"period. When one common physical programme is deliberately used for every "
"period, as in the ordinary Luenberger account, it remains $g$ without a time"
" superscript."
msgstr ""
"全书以小写 $d$ 表示效率形式的径向评价，以不带箭头的大写 $D$ 配合已声明方向 $g$ 表示方向性评价。需要区分两种时间角色时，完整形式为 "
"$d^\\tau(z^\\sigma)$ 和 $D^\\tau(z^\\sigma;g^\\sigma)$，简写为 $d_\\sigma^\\tau$ "
"和 $D_\\sigma^\\tau$。两种形式中，上标 $\\tau$ 都表示提供参照技术的时期，$\\sigma$ "
"表示接受评价的经营方案所属时期。上标 $G$ 表示已声明的全期全局技术，而非日历时期。如果各期有意采用同一个实物改进方案——如通常的 "
"Luenberger 核算——方向仍写作不带时间上标的 $g$。"

#: ../../notation.md:153 4452a316093447a6b074afa3737bd2cb
msgid ""
"The same Greek letter can appear in a cited paper with a different local "
"meaning. Each chapter states any source-specific notation before using it. "
"Across chapters, always rely on the quantity's full name and superscript, "
"not on a bare letter alone."
msgstr "同一个希腊字母在所引论文中可能具有不同的局部含义。各章会在采用特定来源的符号前加以说明。跨章阅读时，应始终依据数量的全称与上标判断含义，不能只看一个孤立字母。"

#: ../../notation.md:158 6b819c8bff1e4cebbb59b14d61592247
msgid "Productivity levels and observed prices"
msgstr "生产率水平与观测价格"

#: ../../notation.md:160 d2f54f52f3ee4e818953fac263e6d340
msgid ""
"In a one-input, one-output account, the observed average product of "
"organization $j$ is"
msgstr "在单投入、单产出的核算中，组织 $j$ 的观测平均产出为"

#: ../../notation.md:163 64e3f4f4a84c47cc826b8887d41d0462
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"AP_j=\\frac{y_j}{x_j}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"AP_j=\\frac{y_j}{x_j}.\n"

#: ../../notation.md:167 5edb912dbf37444b98d1a3fd92e6a3a1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is a quantity ratio for the observed plan, not a frontier-efficiency "
"score. With several inputs or outputs there is no unique physical "
"counterpart until the study declares how quantities are aggregated. A "
"superscript records a case-specific rule: for example, $AP_j^{eq}$ in the "
"opening chapter counts its two service categories equally."
msgstr ""
"它是观测方案的数量比，而不是前沿效率得分。存在多项投入或产出时，只有先声明数量聚合规则，才有唯一的实物对应量。上标记录案例特定规则；例如，开篇的 "
"$AP_j^{eq}$ 对两类服务采用等权计数。"

#: ../../notation.md:173 af1a3c0ae71244a2a124c4cb8d9835d4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For the classic ratios and public models used in this book, $w_o\\in\\mathbb"
" R_{++}^m$ denotes strictly positive input prices and $p_o\\in\\mathbb "
"R_{++}^s$ denotes strictly positive desirable-output prices for organization"
" $o$. The corresponding value accounts are"
msgstr ""
"对于本书采用的经典比率和公开模型，$w_o\\in\\mathbb R_{++}^m$ 表示组织 $o$ "
"严格为正的投入价格，$p_o\\in\\mathbb R_{++}^s$ 表示其严格为正的合意产出价格。相应的价值核算为"

#: ../../notation.md:179 6d645aa241ac4beaba32d9f3c45f3d96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"C_o=w_o^\\top x_o,\\qquad\n"
"R_o=p_o^\\top y_o,\\qquad\n"
"\\Pi_o=R_o-C_o,\\qquad\n"
"\\rho_o^{RTD}=\\frac{R_o}{C_o}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"C_o=w_o^\\top x_o,\\qquad\n"
"R_o=p_o^\\top y_o,\\qquad\n"
"\\Pi_o=R_o-C_o,\\qquad\n"
"\\rho_o^{RTD}=\\frac{R_o}{C_o}.\n"

#: ../../notation.md:186 00b5d47bcd91496988d811bff74b6df1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$C_o$, $R_o$, and $\\Pi_o$ are cost, revenue, and profit. The return-to-"
"dollar quantity $\\rho_o^{RTD}$ is revenue per unit of cost; it is not a "
"profit ratio. Observed prices remain separate from DEA multiplier weights "
"and constraint marginals."
msgstr ""
"$C_o$、$R_o$ 和 $\\Pi_o$ 分别为成本、收益与利润。投入一单位成本的回报量 $\\rho_o^{RTD}$ "
"表示单位成本对应的收益，并非利润比率。观测价格始终与 DEA 乘数权重和约束边际值分开。"

#: ../../notation.md:191 dccf1c9460ea4f51814f3f229c2be1ad
msgid ""
"For the Nerlovian bridge from a declared operating programme to foregone "
"profit, $\\nu_o=w_o^\\top g_o^x+p_o^\\top g_o^y$ is the value of one "
"programme unit and $NI_o=G_o^\\Pi/\\nu_o$ is profit inefficiency measured in"
" those units. The symbol $q$ remains reserved for the number of undesirable "
"outputs."
msgstr ""
"在从已声明经营方案连接到利润损失的 Nerlovian 桥接关系中，$\\nu_o=w_o^\\top g_o^x+p_o^\\top g_o^y$ "
"是一个方案单位的价值，$NI_o=G_o^\\Pi/\\nu_o$ 是用这种单位衡量的利润无效率。符号 $q$ 仍专用于表示非合意产出的个数。"

#: ../../notation.md:196 1110a44c3f214a9c8c56bf1fcf2b26bd
msgid "Slacks, targets, and peers"
msgstr "松弛、目标方案与活跃参照单元"

#: ../../notation.md:198 138e68f8c3a2435fa5f81ddb668b71b2
msgid "The standard slack notation is"
msgstr "标准松弛符号为"

#: ../../notation.md:200 a217a692342d4d25acec846c204b130b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"s^-\\geq0\n"
"\\quad\\text{for input excess},\\qquad\n"
"s^+\\geq0\n"
"\\quad\\text{for desirable-output shortfall},\\qquad\n"
"s^b\\geq0\n"
"\\quad\\text{for undesirable-output excess}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"s^-\\geq0\n"
"\\quad\\text{表示投入冗余},\\qquad\n"
"s^+\\geq0\n"
"\\quad\\text{表示合意产出不足},\\qquad\n"
"s^b\\geq0\n"
"\\quad\\text{表示非合意产出过量}.\n"

#: ../../notation.md:209 dd39f47214fe4421b0d648e3ad86a687
msgid "For the familiar desirable-output balance,"
msgstr "对于常见的合意产出平衡式"

#: ../../notation.md:211 1be8781097324ba4b67d9b08aa040bc3
msgid ""
"\n"
"X\\lambda+s^-=x_o,\\qquad\n"
"Y\\lambda-s^+=y_o,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"X\\lambda+s^-=x_o,\\qquad\n"
"Y\\lambda-s^+=y_o,\n"

#: ../../notation.md:216 f4942edf90734cfa95a615fe470611e5
msgid "the corresponding target is"
msgstr "相应目标方案为"

#: ../../notation.md:218 4abed918886e4d33ae45acd1cb672a07
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\widehat x_o=x_o-s^-,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widehat y_o=y_o+s^+.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\widehat x_o=x_o-s^-,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widehat y_o=y_o+s^+.\n"

#: ../../notation.md:224 d5d2eccca00e44058bcc1af00ddb5525
msgid ""
"A target is a model-supported comparator under the maintained assumptions. "
"It is not automatically a forecast, a unique prescription, or evidence that "
"the change can be implemented without adjustment cost."
msgstr "目标方案是在既定假设下由模型支持的比较方案。它不会自动成为预测或唯一处方，也不能证明相关变化可以在没有调整成本的情况下实施。"

#: ../../notation.md:228 0c526591322342e986e53578bae9aeff
msgid ""
"Network chapters add process superscripts and directed links. An ordered "
"pair $(k,\\ell)$ means that process $k$ supplies an internal quantity to "
"process $\\ell$. When a source uses different letters, the chapter "
"translates them to this system or provides an explicit crosswalk. Dynamic "
"chapters add period-specific peer plans and carry-overs between adjacent "
"periods. Those chapters introduce their link and stock notation where the "
"economic roles are defined."
msgstr ""
"网络章节为过程添加上标，并使用有向联结。有序对 $(k,\\ell)$ 表示过程 $k$ 向过程 $\\ell$ "
"提供内部数量。如果原始来源使用不同字母，相关章节会把它们转换到本书系统，或提供明确的符号对照。动态章节还会加入各期特定的参照方案，以及相邻时期之间的结转变量；这些章节在界定经济角色时一并介绍联结和存量符号。"

#: ../../notation.md:236 c8f31d74ca6845faa21f0bb2185423ee
msgid "Read the economic quantity before the numerical label"
msgstr "先辨认经济数量，再看数值标签"

#: ../../notation.md:238 d0755093f87945fcb3e0b36bdfc4e039
msgid ""
"A reported number may be a bounded efficiency, an expansion factor, a "
"distance, an additive indicator, or a multiplicative index. Its neutral "
"value and direction must therefore travel with it. A value of one means best"
" represented static performance for several efficiency measures, but no "
"productivity change for a multiplicative index. A value of zero means no "
"remaining directional improvement or no additive productivity change, "
"depending on the account."
msgstr ""
"报告值可能是有界效率、扩张因子、距离、加法指标或乘法指数，因此必须同时说明其中性值与数值方向。对于多种效率测度，1 "
"表示样本所能代表的最佳静态表现；对于乘法指数，1 却表示生产率没有变化。0 "
"可能表示不存在剩余的方向性改进，也可能表示加法生产率没有变化，取决于所用核算。"

#: ../../notation.md:245 191ff2185e2c4afc9ce3058cee9475d3
msgid ""
"Figures and tables should name the full quantity rather than relying on a "
"generic column headed “score.” When the maintained analysis has not "
"established strong efficiency, uniqueness, feasibility, or a causal "
"interpretation, the absence of that claim must not be converted into its "
"opposite."
msgstr "图表应写明数量全称，不能依赖一个笼统的“得分”列名。如果当前分析尚未确立强有效、唯一性、可行性或因果解释，不能把“未作出该结论”转写成其反面。"

#: ../../notation.md:250 dc5981af589c44aba143c63159fead80
msgid "Notation beyond this map"
msgstr "本图以外的符号"

#: ../../notation.md:252 5ee3afeda9224e2c858e2ae36007c3b9
msgid ""
"Network, dynamic, environmental, and productivity chapters introduce "
"additional symbols where their organizational or temporal roles are defined."
" The DEAPack Documentation gives the associated returned quantities, data "
"conditions, and compatibility guidance. This page supplies the common "
"language needed to read the book; each chapter still defines its own "
"production account."
msgstr ""
"网络、动态、环境和生产率章节会在界定相应组织角色或时间角色时引入其他符号。DEAPack "
"文档给出相关返回数量、数据条件和兼容性指南。本页提供阅读全书所需的共同语言；各章仍会单独界定自己的生产核算。"
